    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sort + fix one + squeeze</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/3sum-closest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 16</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>3Sum Closest</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Sort, fix the smallest of the three, and squeeze two pointers over the rest: a sum below the target moves the left pointer right, a sum above moves the right pointer left. Track the closest sum on every step and stop early on an exact hit. O(n²) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
